WEBVTT

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:05.663
will not be insulated
against the facts of climate breakdown.

00:02:05.705 --> 00:02:10.459
And yet, still, we go on
heating up the planet.

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:13.337
Still we go on polluting the earth.

00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:16.841
Still we despoil

00:02:16.883 --> 00:02:21.012
our precious natural resources.

00:02:22.305 --> 00:02:28.394
250 years ago, we kick-started
the Industrial Revolution.

00:02:28.394 --> 00:02:30.354
The machine age.